					</p>
					<p>
						Write a function named <pf>isXPrime</pf> that tests whether a given positive integer is prime. 
						Use a <pf>for</pf> loop and the <pf>mod</pf> function.
					</p>
					<p>
						As a comment in your code (below HR statement), explain why it is enough to check divisors up to the square root of the number you are testing. 
						Give an example to support your explanation.
					</p>
					<tabular valign="top" halign="right" top="minor">
